        "text": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">2.5 million</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">patients develop pressure injuries in acute care facilities each year<sup>1</sup></span></p>\n",
