        "text": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #85458a;\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">80%&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">of healthcare workers report working with pain or injury<sup>2</sup></span></p>\n",
